<description>&lt;p&gt;President De la Espriella has intensified militarization in Cúcuta and along the Venezuelan border as alleged Venezuelan forces bombed an ELN camp and a separate strike reportedly killed at least 19 near the border. Colombian forces have charged nine former FARC commanders with war crimes while conducting an anti-narcotics operation that has drawn scrutiny over civilian killings. US troops have arrived in Colombia under Operation Condor, and the UN Verification Mission in Colombia has had its mandate renewed by the Security Council. The conflict recorded 225 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxPc1ZSZlJhZnhXbWtIVDhwaTZWeGVLQlo5LVhGZ3kzcnVicUQ5dXVEOFNCWDlZcHR6M2YyV2NVN0pCTGphYy1sTlpLbXp0dXB5ekk0c0p2Z1A5N3AxVTB6dGVxajVKLTJHcGFiVW82a21HenJTdkQzcndRV21uaXc5R1ZTWk9JVlUwU3B2OVlyYVNSakZ3d0JVcWRPY3pzcG94UlJXZGd3?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxOeHdaRk9SZEtoQUtuUmxVTTBFMXk1SjdBV29NaS0wVGtEcGstRDZ6MXh6eFN4XzcyY3lWZXNhNlUxeVhtSW5idE04cmRmd1VYRWFnTk5aOThkQ3BBRE84N0p1dlBUMEp0VG9ITFBidEczZGdScUdaNkF0ZVcwY3hzVkgwSnktSWd2OU1rWWNEb1lJeGx1WmJvVXJsSkxnME1pVkNfRE1qbUFQeEdQcm52UjRsaEw?oc=5&quot;&gt;teleSUR English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiekFVX3lxTE9rV2Y0Xy00bUQ1TVF0M0dUYUlOVkljYWR0VTRUZ2xvUTFpMERXTHM3dkdqMU55aWk0amphUmdZd21maDJpQmdBN0o3WnMwYmdnTm5zS0t3RTg0dzVlN3J2Y1ctWnFtTGQ5Zk12aU9zVmdqS0Z5U2ZoMWVR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sada Elbalad English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Fox News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxOaklaYkpnSzV1SFdYVlBKd2Z2VU5WSEZYSkZaNVNFSURFdlEzM3EzQ3pLb3FjaHQ2dnQ